    "## 1.2 — Script Principal do Encoder (GOP + armazenamento + análise de bits)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 28,
   "id": "quality-metrics",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Funções de qualidade (psnr, compute_ssim) prontas.\n"
     ]
